{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/0191ab0dc8f1b4d3fdeebbbd0940cb03.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/0191ab0dc8f1b4d3fdeebbbd0940cb03.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/0191ab0dc8f1b4d3fdeebbbd0940cb03.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/c7df70406f2590df93bdd2709e3f5e40.avif?t=1761404812\" data-has-big width=800 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/b193901dcf30c2d5afe1ca6c64cd537f.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/b193901dcf30c2d5afe1ca6c64cd537f.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/b193901dcf30c2d5afe1ca6c64cd537f.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/dca668b223513062cd19f275b9f48cee.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/dca668b223513062cd19f275b9f48cee.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/dca668b223513062cd19f275b9f48cee.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Action Game Focused on Melee Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dawn of Kemet</i> is a 2D action game with an ancient Egyptian theme. Immerse yourself in rhythmic melee combat, utilizing weapons like swords, shields, and lances, with more than five other cold weapons planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/64c2550ab4ba250c5295765ada13ee1f.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/64c2550ab4ba250c5295765ada13ee1f.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/64c2550ab4ba250c5295765ada13ee1f.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2015\u2015\u2015Shield blocking, parrying, guarding, lance stepping, and more...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch weapons during battle, and each weapon comes with its own set of actions, allowing you to develop your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/1372f1a5960f035d11d450833126bde5.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/1372f1a5960f035d11d450833126bde5.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/1372f1a5960f035d11d450833126bde5.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Bosses with Unique Characteristics and Charms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015\u2015The Executioner of the Underworld, the Dancer of Rest\u2026 Defeat the various gods with unique personalities and charms using your strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These ruthless bosses will challenge you with overwhelming power. Attack and accumulate damage to bring them into a groggy state for a more powerful strike. Depending on the boss, you may witness phase transitions, part destruction, and changes in appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/569685e29b222a2c05ab15319d3c6eef.avif?t=1761404812\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Boss Rush Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bosses here feature challenging difficulty levels. Avoid, counter, and dismantle their relentless patterns in your own style, and defeat the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've streamlined the exploration process leading to each boss, offering a boss rush format with consecutive battles. Face the trials without pause and rise to the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing bosses allows you to craft new equipment. With enhanced strength, take the fate of Kemet into your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/3971c4afa5766271d104e00b77643f13.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/3971c4afa5766271d104e00b77643f13.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/3971c4afa5766271d104e00b77643f13.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Good luck.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994090?t=1761404812","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994090?t=1761404812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761404812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761404812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Blood effect during battle (in color black)\r\nExposure: Implied-nudity(No genitals exposure)"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/0191ab0dc8f1b4d3fdeebbbd0940cb03.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/0191ab0dc8f1b4d3fdeebbbd0940cb03.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/0191ab0dc8f1b4d3fdeebbbd0940cb03.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/c7df70406f2590df93bdd2709e3f5e40.avif?t=1761404812\" data-has-big width=800 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/b193901dcf30c2d5afe1ca6c64cd537f.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/b193901dcf30c2d5afe1ca6c64cd537f.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/b193901dcf30c2d5afe1ca6c64cd537f.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/dca668b223513062cd19f275b9f48cee.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/dca668b223513062cd19f275b9f48cee.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/dca668b223513062cd19f275b9f48cee.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Action Game Focused on Melee Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dawn of Kemet</i> is a 2D action game with an ancient Egyptian theme. Immerse yourself in rhythmic melee combat, utilizing weapons like swords, shields, and lances, with more than five other cold weapons planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/64c2550ab4ba250c5295765ada13ee1f.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/64c2550ab4ba250c5295765ada13ee1f.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/64c2550ab4ba250c5295765ada13ee1f.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2015\u2015\u2015Shield blocking, parrying, guarding, lance stepping, and more...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch weapons during battle, and each weapon comes with its own set of actions, allowing you to develop your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/1372f1a5960f035d11d450833126bde5.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/1372f1a5960f035d11d450833126bde5.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/1372f1a5960f035d11d450833126bde5.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Bosses with Unique Characteristics and Charms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015\u2015The Executioner of the Underworld, the Dancer of Rest\u2026 Defeat the various gods with unique personalities and charms using your strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These ruthless bosses will challenge you with overwhelming power. Attack and accumulate damage to bring them into a groggy state for a more powerful strike. Depending on the boss, you may witness phase transitions, part destruction, and changes in appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/569685e29b222a2c05ab15319d3c6eef.avif?t=1761404812\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Boss Rush Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bosses here feature challenging difficulty levels. Avoid, counter, and dismantle their relentless patterns in your own style, and defeat the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've streamlined the exploration process leading to each boss, offering a boss rush format with consecutive battles. Face the trials without pause and rise to the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing bosses allows you to craft new equipment. With enhanced strength, take the fate of Kemet into your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/3971c4afa5766271d104e00b77643f13.poster.avif?t=1761404812\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/3971c4afa5766271d104e00b77643f13.webm?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/3971c4afa5766271d104e00b77643f13.mp4?t=1761404812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Good luck.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["IKINAGAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/header.jpg?t=1761404812","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 IKINAGAMES all rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Dawn of Kemet","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium G4500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GT 1030<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["IKINAGAMES"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Nudez\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nSexuelle Andeutungen","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_da